# Project Overview

This is a Flutter expense tracker application targeting:
- Android
- PWA web

The app must be:
- Vietnamese-first
- User-centered
- Mobile-first
- Simple and easy to use daily
- Modern, friendly, and highly rounded in design
- Suitable for personal finance and daily expense tracking

Core product goals:
- Help users record expenses quickly.
- Help users understand spending habits.
- Reduce friction when entering transactions.
- Make financial summaries easy to understand.
- Support Vietnamese users naturally and completely.

Important:
- All user-facing text must be in Vietnamese by default.
- Do not generate English UI text unless explicitly requested.
- Prioritize clarity, simplicity, and usability over unnecessary complexity.
